WEBVTT

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.760
Claire, it's me.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:49.630
Don't be scared.

00:00:49.630 --> 00:00:51.600
If an evil spirit comes, I'll defeat it.

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:58.980
I promise to protect you.

00:01:16.550 --> 00:01:18.760
Let's go back.

00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:20.760
You're the one who wanted to go exploring.

00:01:20.950 --> 00:01:23.490
Are you scared?

00:01:23.490 --> 00:01:25.800
I'm not scared!

00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:30.100
I just thought that Luca might be scared.

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:31.240
I'm fine.

00:01:31.240 --> 00:01:34.490
Really?  Then me too!

00:01:51.260 --> 00:01:53.370
There's something up ahead.

00:02:04.730 --> 00:02:08.170
Luca, I sense strong emotions ahead!

00:02:08.170 --> 00:02:09.610
You have to go back.

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:41.060
Every time you're hurt, you can become kinder

00:02:41.420 --> 00:02:46.590
Stand up and you'll understand strength

00:02:46.930 --> 00:02:51.070
Don't look back and keep going

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:56.910
Both the past and the future 
are connected to the present

00:02:57.070 --> 00:03:01.880
There's no need to fear

00:03:02.110 --> 00:03:09.550
I'll keep telling you that you're not alone

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:15.560
The passionate emotions in your heart

00:03:16.290 --> 00:03:21.330
Streak to the infinite future

00:03:21.530 --> 00:03:26.730
Dreams surpass their limits

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:34.840
And will lead you to a bright place

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:07.220
Forest of Mysterious 
DisappearancesSleepy Beauty

00:04:12.050 --> 00:04:13.260
Mysterious disappearances?

00:04:13.260 --> 00:04:16.420
That's the rumor running around these days.

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:20.040
Many people have vanished in the forest.

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:25.010
The kids in the neighborhood say that 
there's a phantom in the forest.

00:04:25.890 --> 00:04:28.210
Is this related to Ghost?

00:04:31.590 --> 00:04:33.540
You're overthinking it.

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:37.540
Kids love scary stories and urban legends.

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:40.560
Well, I'm off to work.

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:51.980
Huh?

00:04:52.490 --> 00:04:53.970
Where am I?

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:59.250
Lua!  Tempei!  Where are you?

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:13.670
Is there really something up ahead?

00:05:23.770 --> 00:05:27.540
Anyone!  Lua!  Help me!

00:05:33.590 --> 00:05:34.710
Are you okay?

00:05:36.710 --> 00:05:38.180
Are you hurt?

00:05:39.260 --> 00:05:40.420
Who are you?

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:44.060
I'm Michel.  Who are you?

00:05:44.060 --> 00:05:46.020
I'm Luca.

00:05:46.020 --> 00:05:47.630
Nice to meet you, Luca.

00:05:47.630 --> 00:05:50.030
It's dangerous to be here alone.

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:53.300
There are scary evil spirits in this forest.

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:54.620
Evil spirits?

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:56.800
I know!  Come to my home!

00:05:56.800 --> 00:06:02.640
My younger sister Claire will be happy if 
you play with her, and you'll also be safe.

00:06:03.180 --> 00:06:05.610
There's a mansion out here?

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:14.720
Yusei!

00:06:15.450 --> 00:06:16.960
Yusei!

00:06:16.960 --> 00:06:19.390
What's wrong, Tempei?  You look worried.

00:06:19.890 --> 00:06:22.190
Luca is lost in the forest!

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:22.830
What?

00:06:22.830 --> 00:06:25.490
Lua went to the forest to look for her!

00:06:25.490 --> 00:06:27.760
Is it the forest with the disappearances?

00:06:33.140 --> 00:06:34.680
Luca!

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:39.000
Luca!

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:45.260
What was that?

00:06:47.150 --> 00:06:50.480
I can't be scared!  I have to find Luca!

00:06:50.480 --> 00:06:53.030
Luca!

00:06:55.330 --> 00:06:56.590
Come in.

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:06.130
You're dueling the evil spirits 
in the forest to defeat them?

00:07:06.130 --> 00:07:09.240
Yes, but no one believes me.

00:07:10.190 --> 00:07:15.480
I believe you because I can 
see Duel Monsters spirits.

00:07:15.480 --> 00:07:17.170
Just like I thought!

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:19.450
I sensed it the moment I met you.

00:07:19.730 --> 00:07:22.150
You have a strange power.

00:07:31.940 --> 00:07:33.860
Claire, you have a guest.

00:07:33.860 --> 00:07:35.300
Hello.

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:37.840
Claire, you should also say hello.

00:07:40.150 --> 00:07:41.810
Maybe she's sleeping.

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:44.080
She's always asleep because she's sick.

00:07:44.490 --> 00:07:47.330
Claire is scared of the 
evil spirits' shadows.

00:07:48.050 --> 00:07:51.550
I'm the only one who can protect Claire.

00:07:52.170 --> 00:07:55.070
You're the only ones living in this mansion?

00:07:55.070 --> 00:07:56.420
Where are your parents?

00:07:57.050 --> 00:08:01.170
They left a long time ago without telling us.

00:08:01.770 --> 00:08:04.260
He's just like me.

00:08:08.600 --> 00:08:09.730
What's wrong?

00:08:10.240 --> 00:08:11.530
Something is coming.

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:13.610
It must be an evil spirit!

00:08:15.460 --> 00:08:17.410
You stay with Claire!

00:08:17.670 --> 00:08:19.680
Don't leave this room!

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:22.080
Wait!

00:08:22.290 --> 00:08:23.460
I'll come too!

00:08:26.350 --> 00:08:27.520
What is that?

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:31.520
It's an old mansion.  Is she in there?

00:08:35.670 --> 00:08:37.120
What is it?

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:40.330
Evil spirit, I won't let you go any further!

00:08:40.610 --> 00:08:42.330
Come duel me!

00:08:42.850 --> 00:08:45.070
Evil spirit?  Me?

00:08:49.940 --> 00:08:50.910
Lua?

00:08:50.910 --> 00:08:52.720
What's going on?

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:53.740
Lua!

00:08:56.110 --> 00:08:57.320
Luca?

00:08:59.810 --> 00:09:02.050
I said that I won't let you go any further!

00:09:02.490 --> 00:09:06.020
Why are you holding Luca hostage?

00:09:10.140 --> 00:09:12.430
I'm getting Luca back!

00:09:12.590 --> 00:09:14.850
Claire, your brother!

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:20.240
A doll?

00:09:37.050 --> 00:09:38.020
Duel!

00:09:42.240 --> 00:09:45.600
Luca, I promise to rescue you!

00:09:45.950 --> 00:09:47.020
Lua…

00:09:47.330 --> 00:09:49.600
My turn!  I draw!

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:53.300
I activate the Continuous 
Spell Circle of Life!

00:09:54.390 --> 00:09:56.090
What's this?

00:09:56.970 --> 00:09:59.980
During each of our turns, we can't use spells

00:09:59.980 --> 00:10:03.880
unless we send a spell card in 
our hand to the graveyard first!

00:10:03.880 --> 00:10:04.680
What?

00:10:04.900 --> 00:10:07.040
I'll show you my combo.

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:09.150
I send Mirror Prison to the graveyard.

00:10:09.870 --> 00:10:14.090
I activate another Continuous 
Spell!  Circle of Terror!

00:10:16.950 --> 00:10:20.300
During each of our turns, 
we can't summon a monster

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:24.030
without sending a monster card in 
our hand to the graveyard first.

00:10:28.130 --> 00:10:32.200
His power is imprisoning Luca.

00:10:33.890 --> 00:10:38.230
I can't do anything unless I 
discard from my hand every turn.

00:10:40.400 --> 00:10:44.910
I send the Zombie-Type Sleepy Beauty to 
the graveyard to activate its effect.

00:10:45.520 --> 00:10:47.520
When Sleepy Beauty is in the graveyard,

00:10:47.520 --> 00:10:50.380
the Level of Zombie-Type monsters 
in my hand decrease by 1.

00:10:50.380 --> 00:10:55.330
Level 5 Hollow Spirit becomes Level 
4, so it can be Normal Summoned.

00:10:57.460 --> 00:11:03.280
I can't attack on my first turn, but 
you still take Hollow Spirit's effect!

00:11:04.070 --> 00:11:08.880
When a Zombie-Type monster is in my 
graveyard, you take 800 points of damage!

00:11:11.340 --> 00:11:12.800
I end my turn.

00:11:14.050 --> 00:11:17.790
It feels like I'm literally 
losing my life energy.

00:11:17.790 --> 00:11:20.530
Is he a psychic duelist?

00:11:23.460 --> 00:11:25.090
I have to stay strong!

00:11:25.090 --> 00:11:28.430
If I get scared, I can't save Luca!

00:11:29.090 --> 00:11:30.930
My turn!  I draw!

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:34.910
I need to break this combo!

00:11:35.510 --> 00:11:38.310
I send Morphtronic Datatron to the graveyard!

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:42.850
You can't break my combo 
just by summoning monsters.

00:11:43.820 --> 00:11:46.550
Since I sent Mirror Prison to the graveyard,

00:11:46.550 --> 00:11:49.550
your monster can't attack unless you 
tribute a monster with the same Type.

00:11:49.550 --> 00:11:52.950
But this doesn't affect 
Zombie and Machine-Types.

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:56.320
Then it doesn't work against my deck!

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:58.400
I summon Morphtronic Scopen!

00:12:02.140 --> 00:12:03.600
You have a Machine-Type deck?

00:12:03.600 --> 00:12:05.070
Exactly!

00:12:05.070 --> 00:12:10.600
Due to Scopen's effect, I Special Summon 
Level 4 Morphtronic Videon from my hand!

00:12:16.780 --> 00:12:21.780
Level 3 Morphtronic Scopen tunes 
Level 4 Morphtronic Videon!

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:27.220
In order to protect world peace, 
courage and power dock together!

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:29.490
Synchro Summon!

00:12:29.760 --> 00:12:33.170
The emissary of love and 
justice!  Power Tool Dragon!

00:12:34.180 --> 00:12:39.370
You're lucky, but I'll never lose 
to something that has no soul.

00:12:39.370 --> 00:12:41.370
Don't insult Power Tool Dragon!

00:12:41.670 --> 00:12:43.610
I activate Power Tool Dragon's effect!

00:12:43.910 --> 00:12:47.540
I add one random Equip Spell 
in my deck to my hand!

00:12:47.970 --> 00:12:53.220
I send Morphtronic Cord to my graveyard to 
equip Break! Draw! on Power Tool Dragon!

00:13:03.700 --> 00:13:05.000
Lua, are you okay?

00:13:05.170 --> 00:13:06.380
Yusei!

00:13:06.380 --> 00:13:08.430
Another evil spirit has appeared!

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:10.430
What's this duel field?

00:13:10.430 --> 00:13:13.170
Yusei, I'm fine, so you rescue Luca!

00:13:13.170 --> 00:13:15.380
She's trapped inside that house!

00:13:15.380 --> 00:13:16.480
Luca!

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:20.040
I won't let you take a single 
step inside this house.

00:13:23.340 --> 00:13:25.020
I'm your opponent!

00:13:25.020 --> 00:13:29.380
Battle!  Power Tool Dragon 
attacks Hollow Spirit!

00:13:29.380 --> 00:13:30.960
Crafty Break!

00:13:41.790 --> 00:13:42.850
Luca!

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:44.400
Yusei?

00:13:46.140 --> 00:13:48.140
I activate the effect of Break! Draw!

00:13:48.140 --> 00:13:53.120
Since Power Tool Dragon destroyed 
your monster, I draw one card!

00:13:55.110 --> 00:13:56.080
I won't forgive you.

00:13:56.260 --> 00:14:01.360
I won't forgive anyone who tries 
to hurt someone dear to me!

00:14:05.050 --> 00:14:05.930
Lua!

00:14:09.360 --> 00:14:10.330
What's this?

00:14:10.650 --> 00:14:15.180
A long time ago, a rich family 
lived deep in the woods.

00:14:15.430 --> 00:14:18.340
Both brother and sister had poor health.

00:14:18.340 --> 00:14:24.970
The brother nursed his sister, but he 
overworked himself and died before her.

00:14:25.410 --> 00:14:29.250
The sister died soon after.

00:14:32.960 --> 00:14:35.990
Is he the evil spirit?

00:14:36.460 --> 00:14:39.130
In that case, I definitely can't lose!

00:14:39.380 --> 00:14:42.060
I won't let an evil spirit take Luca!

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:47.000
When Hollow Spirit is sent to the graveyard, 
a new door in the graveyard opens!

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:49.640
Appear, Hollow Ghost!

00:14:58.330 --> 00:15:00.590
2600 attack points?

00:15:00.590 --> 00:15:03.490
Just when I defeated Hollow Spirit!

00:15:05.290 --> 00:15:09.590
Calm down.  I have to find 
some way to defeat it.

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:10.860
Lua...

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:18.130
Where's my brother?

00:15:20.610 --> 00:15:23.000
Are you...

00:15:23.160 --> 00:15:27.290
Brother, don't leave Claire all alone!

00:15:27.970 --> 00:15:32.440
You're Claire, right?  
Where are you right now?

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:36.180
Brother!

00:15:40.100 --> 00:15:43.020
I set one card and end my turn.

00:15:43.020 --> 00:15:46.300
I won't let you possess my 
sister and take her life!

00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:50.990
I'll protect Claire, even 
if it costs me my life!

00:15:50.990 --> 00:15:52.180
Sister?

00:15:52.180 --> 00:15:54.460
Here I go!  My turn!

00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:55.930
Battle!

00:15:55.930 --> 00:15:59.550
Hollow Ghost attacks Power Tool Dragon!

00:16:04.170 --> 00:16:08.810
I send Break! Draw! to the graveyard to 
negate Power Tool Dragon's destruction!

00:16:10.580 --> 00:16:12.920
I activate Hollow Ghost's effect!

00:16:12.920 --> 00:16:17.550
When a card is sent to the graveyard, 
you take 600 points of damage!

00:16:21.140 --> 00:16:24.400
Then due to Circle of Life and 
Circle of Terror's effects,

00:16:24.400 --> 00:16:27.650
I send a spell card and a 
monster card to the graveyard!

00:16:27.650 --> 00:16:32.060
Due to Hollow Ghost's effect, 
you take 1200 points of damage!

00:16:41.380 --> 00:16:43.380
What are these voices?

00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:47.700
Save me!

00:16:47.700 --> 00:16:49.700
Let me out of here!

00:16:50.540 --> 00:16:54.440
Are they the missing people?

00:16:55.320 --> 00:16:58.210
I end my turn.

00:17:01.210 --> 00:17:05.770
I get it.  You're trying 
to protect your sister.

00:17:05.770 --> 00:17:08.790
I know how you feel.

00:17:09.480 --> 00:17:12.240
That's why I can't lose!

00:17:12.240 --> 00:17:15.710
My sister Luca is irreplaceable!

00:17:17.290 --> 00:17:19.210
My turn!  I draw!

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:21.850
It's here!

00:17:24.280 --> 00:17:28.460
If the power of these Circles 
are imprisoning Luca…

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:30.330
I activate a trap!

00:17:30.330 --> 00:17:32.960
Morphtronic Impact Return!

00:17:32.960 --> 00:17:36.030
I return one Morphtronic 
in my hand to my deck.

00:17:36.240 --> 00:17:40.040
Circle of Life and Circle of 
Terror return to your hand!

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:41.100
What?

00:17:50.430 --> 00:17:51.250
Luca!

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:52.480
Yusei!

00:17:53.990 --> 00:17:55.090
Are you okay?

00:17:55.090 --> 00:17:57.450
We have to free that child quickly!

00:17:57.450 --> 00:18:00.630
Or else, we can't save Michel or Claire!

00:18:01.860 --> 00:18:04.150
Where are you, brother?

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:05.930
Brother…

00:18:15.330 --> 00:18:16.650
How dare you!

00:18:16.650 --> 00:18:21.590
But since a card was sent to the graveyard, 
you take Hollow Ghost's effect!

00:18:27.630 --> 00:18:30.050
I activate Power Tool Dragon's effect!

00:18:30.050 --> 00:18:33.760
A random Equip Spell in my 
deck is added to my hand.

00:18:34.020 --> 00:18:37.700
Please have the power to protect 
what's important to me!

00:18:38.620 --> 00:18:39.590
Here it is!

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:43.370
I equip Power Pickaxe on Power Tool Dragon!

00:18:43.650 --> 00:18:46.770
Due to Power Pickaxe's effect, 
a monster in your graveyard

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:50.070
with lower Level than Power Tool 
Dragon is removed from play!

00:18:50.420 --> 00:18:52.560
I remove Hollow Spirit!

00:18:52.840 --> 00:18:58.350
When Hollow Spirit isn't in your graveyard, 
Hollow Ghost has 0 attack points!

00:19:00.520 --> 00:19:06.990
Power Tool Dragon gains half the attack 
points of the monster that was removed from play!

00:19:06.990 --> 00:19:11.460
Battle!  Power Tool Dragon 
attacks Hollow Ghost!

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:13.900
Crafty Break!

00:19:25.770 --> 00:19:29.850
I didn't have enough power to protect Claire.

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:31.270
That's not true.

00:19:34.080 --> 00:19:35.300
Luca!

00:19:35.300 --> 00:19:36.210
Lua!

00:19:36.210 --> 00:19:37.530
Brother!

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:42.990
Claire!  What are you doing?

00:19:42.990 --> 00:19:44.990
You have to stay in your room and sleep!

00:19:45.310 --> 00:19:48.460
Brother, don't hurt these people.

00:19:48.460 --> 00:19:52.080
He was also trying to protect his sister.

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:53.110
What?

00:19:54.440 --> 00:19:55.250
Lua!

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:57.140
Luca, you're safe!

00:19:57.140 --> 00:19:58.960
Thanks to you, Lua!

00:19:58.960 --> 00:20:00.640
Thank goodness!

00:20:04.130 --> 00:20:07.850
Brother, you don't need 
to protect me anymore.

00:20:08.380 --> 00:20:12.850
You know that we're already…

00:20:15.870 --> 00:20:19.580
Claire, I wasn't able to protect you.

00:20:20.060 --> 00:20:23.830
You protected me plenty.

00:20:24.530 --> 00:20:28.900
Luca and Lua, I was horrible to you.

00:20:28.900 --> 00:20:34.280
It's okay.  You were just doing 
your best to protect Claire.

00:20:37.930 --> 00:20:38.980
Here.

00:20:43.030 --> 00:20:45.050
Brother, let's go.

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:46.020
Yeah.

00:20:47.460 --> 00:20:49.990
Lua, keep Luca safe for me.

00:20:49.990 --> 00:20:52.470
Yup!  I'll protect Luca!

00:21:09.630 --> 00:21:11.230
Who are they?

00:21:11.230 --> 00:21:13.380
They're the missing people.

00:21:13.380 --> 00:21:17.520
Michel didn't know that he was already dead,

00:21:17.520 --> 00:21:22.120
so his strong desire to 
protect Claire kept him here.

00:21:22.790 --> 00:21:27.820
He thought that the people who came here 
were evil spirits, so he trapped them.

00:21:28.640 --> 00:21:32.350
I sorta understand how he feels.

00:21:32.350 --> 00:21:35.780
If he was still alive, we 
might have been friends.

00:21:35.780 --> 00:21:37.070
Same here.

00:21:37.070 --> 00:21:40.250
Let's go home.  Tempei is worried.

00:21:40.250 --> 00:21:43.080
Oh yeah!  I forgot about him!

00:21:43.300 --> 00:21:45.080
Sheesh, Lua.

00:22:09.560 --> 00:22:13.990
The small cliff floats on the Milky Way

00:22:13.990 --> 00:22:19.000
The sights I see are different 
than what I imagined

00:22:19.260 --> 00:22:23.900
Were you able to move on from the past?

00:22:23.900 --> 00:22:28.910
The answer isn't no, but 
there's something missing

00:22:29.110 --> 00:22:33.780
The cruel god tests us

00:22:34.080 --> 00:22:40.720
Let's fill the emptiness 
and head to the next stage

00:22:40.720 --> 00:22:44.590
If you ask me "What's our relationship?"

00:22:44.590 --> 00:22:50.460
We're more than friends... 
but that's not quite right

00:22:50.630 --> 00:22:54.360
Bond is the proper word

00:22:54.360 --> 00:23:00.340
As we fight, we understand each other

00:23:00.340 --> 00:23:03.310
"Where are you right now?"  "On Earth"

00:23:03.310 --> 00:23:05.540
Because I'm not an astronaut

00:23:05.540 --> 00:23:10.220
I have no problems when 
I'm below the ozone layer

00:23:10.510 --> 00:23:13.080
"I know, I'm coming right away."

00:23:13.080 --> 00:23:16.550
You want to party until the morning

00:23:16.550 --> 00:23:19.790
At our special place
